          "children": [
            {
              "name": "paragraph",
              "props": {
                "text": "FIELD REVIEW  /  ISSUE 07",
                "font": {
                  "size": 8,
                  "bold": true,
                  "color": "accent",
                  "characterSpacing": {
                    "type": "expanded",
                    "value": 20
                  }
                },
                "spacing": {
                  "before": 0,
                  "after": 12
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "paragraph",
              "props": {
                "text": "Cities after\nthe commute",
                "themeStyle": "title"
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "paragraph",
              "props": {
                "text": "A compact briefing on how hybrid work is reshaping neighbourhoods, retail and the design of everyday urban life.",
                "themeStyle": "subtitle"
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "divider",
              "props": {
                "color": "accent",
                "thickness": 1.5,
                "spacing": {
                  "before": 2,
                  "after": 12
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "paragraph",
              "props": {
                "text": "THE SHIFT",
                "font": {
                  "size": 8,
                  "bold": true,
                  "color": "accent",
                  "characterSpacing": {
                    "type": "expanded",
                    "value": 20
                  }
                },
                "spacing": {
                  "before": 0,
                  "after": 6
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "paragraph",
              "props": {
                "text": "The office did not disappear; it became episodic. That small change has large spatial consequences. Footfall now arrives in pulses, lunch peaks are shorter, and residential districts carry more weekday energy than they did five years ago."
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "paragraph",
              "props": {
                "text": "For landlords and operators, the useful question is no longer “where are people working?” but “what rhythm does this place need to support?” The answer increasingly combines focus, hospitality, errands and social contact within a much tighter radius.",
                "spacing": {
                  "after": 10
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "text-box",
              "props": {
                "width": "100%",
                "style": {
                  "padding": {
                    "top": 8,
                    "right": 12,
                    "bottom": 8,
                    "left": 12
                  },
                  "border": {
                    "left": {
                      "style": "solid",
                      "width": 2.25,
                      "color": "accent"
                    },
                    "top": {
                      "style": "none"
                    },
                    "bottom": {
                      "style": "none"
                    },
                    "right": {
                      "style": "none"
                    }
                  },
                  "shading": {
                    "fill": "backgroundSecondary"
                  }
                }
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "name": "paragraph",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "“The winning district is not the busiest one. It is the one that remains useful across the whole day.”",
                    "font": {
                      "size": 10.5,
                      "bold": true,
                      "color": "textPrimary",
                      "lineSpacing": {
                        "type": "multiple",
                        "value": 1.25
                      }
                    },
                    "spacing": {
                      "before": 0,
                      "after": 0
                    }
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "paragraph",
              "props": {
                "text": "DESIGN PRINCIPLE",
                "font": {
                  "size": 8,
                  "bold": true,
                  "color": "accent",
                  "characterSpacing": {
                    "type": "expanded",
                    "value": 20
                  }
                },
                "spacing": {
                  "before": 12,
                  "after": 6
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "paragraph",
              "props": {
                "text": "That reframes mixed-use planning as an operating model rather than a zoning label.",
                "spacing": {
                  "after": 0
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "paragraph",
              "props": {
                "text": "THREE SIGNALS",
                "columnBreak": true,
                "font": {
                  "size": 8,
                  "bold": true,
                  "color": "accent",
                  "characterSpacing": {
                    "type": "expanded",
                    "value": 20
                  }
                },
                "spacing": {
                  "before": 0,
                  "after": 8
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "paragraph",
              "props": {
                "text": "01   **Midweek density**",
                "font": {
                  "size": 12.5,
                  "color": "accent"
                },
                "boldColor": "primary",
                "spacing": {
                  "before": 4,
                  "after": 3
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "paragraph",
              "props": {
                "text": "Tuesday to Thursday still concentrate office demand, but the strongest districts smooth the curve with culture, services and evening programming.",
                "font": {
                  "size": 8.5
                },
                "spacing": {
                  "after": 9
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "paragraph",
              "props": {
                "text": "02   **Smaller radii**",
                "font": {
                  "size": 12.5,
                  "color": "accent"
                },
                "boldColor": "primary",
                "spacing": {
                  "before": 4,
                  "after": 3
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "paragraph",
              "props": {
                "text": "People are making more local decisions: coffee, fitness, healthcare and informal meetings compete within a fifteen-minute catchment.",
                "font": {
                  "size": 8.5
                },
                "spacing": {
                  "after": 9
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "paragraph",
              "props": {
                "text": "03   **Third-space quality**",
                "font": {
                  "size": 12.5,
                  "color": "accent"
                },
                "boldColor": "primary",
                "spacing": {
                  "before": 4,
                  "after": 3
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "paragraph",
              "props": {
                "text": "Lobbies, cafés and libraries now absorb tasks once reserved for desks. Comfort, power, acoustics and permission to linger matter more.",
                "font": {
                  "size": 8.5
                },
                "spacing": {
                  "after": 0
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
